Description: Wild OS window client for Windows mode
 Shows each Windows app from Windows mode as a window of its own on the
 Wild OS desktop, drawn at the screen's own scale, with copy and paste,
 sound and the shared folders. While Windows wakes, the window is already
 there with the Wild OS mark in it.
